<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin appeals for unity, says back at work.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin appeals for unity, says back at work.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin appealed on Wednesday for national unity and said he was back at work after his heart bypass surgery.</p>
<p>&quot;We are one nation. We have one fate, one future. And we are all from the same past,&quot; Yeltsin said in a declaration to the Russian people issued by the Kremlin press office.</p>
</text>
